title: Java Insecure Deserialization Payload
id: ecca39dd-549a-4fca-aa8e-dfa4d380fe68
status: experimental
description: Detects Java deserialization exploitation, indicated by serialized-object magic bytes (rO0AB base64 / ac ed 00 05) and ysoserial gadget-chain markers in HTTP request bodies or parameters.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1190/
logsource:
  category: webserver
detection:
  selection:
    cs-uri-query|contains:
      - 'rO0AB'
      - 'aced0005'
      - 'CommonsCollections'
      - 'ysoserial'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - cs-uri-query
  - cs-uri-stem
  - c-ip
falsepositives:
  - Applications that legitimately transport serialized Java objects
level: high
tags:
  - attack.initial_access
  - attack.t1190
